= The Rim Turns Out

With the Rimward faction leading the party, the Rim's own people come to the Caucus. On Rodia, Ryloth and a hundred smaller worlds, volunteers knock on doors, run broadcasts from cargo holds and send their savings to the Caucus's campaign.
